# The split procedure, spelled correctly

The negative control, and the only case that reaches every rule the guard has.
Without at least one input the guard must let through, every assertion in the
sweep is satisfied by a guard that exits 1 on everything.

All three paths in the guard's `REQUIRED_SOTS` floor are built here, each with
both branches split across two commands and the wait stated between them. The
sweep reads that list out of the guard and fails an accept case that skips one,
because such a case accepts without the second check ever having a subject.
